{
  "name": "DocuWare Upload Beispiel",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## DocuWare Upload\n\n**Produktive Kette:** Form-Trigger → Edit Fields → Upload.\n\n1. Im Upload-Node den Ziel-Schrank wählen.\n2. Einmal den Node **\"Get Fields (Vorlage holen)\"** unten ausführen und das `jsonTemplate` aus dem Output kopieren.\n3. In **\"Indexfelder setzen\"** als JSON einfügen und die Beispielwerte durch echte Werte/Expressions ersetzen.\n\nWichtig im Edit-Fields-Node: *Include Other Input Fields* aktiviert lassen und *Strip Binary Data* deaktiviert — sonst geht die Datei vor dem Upload verloren. Das Binärfeld heißt wie das Formularfeld-Label (hier: \"Beleg\").",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
      "name": "Anleitung",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -380]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Beleg-Upload",
        "formDescription": "PDF hochladen und in DocuWare archivieren",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Beleg",
              "fieldType": "file",
              "acceptFileTypes": ".pdf",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Rechnungsnummer",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Firma"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Formular (PDF-Upload)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "={\n  \"COMPANY\": \"{{ $json.Firma }}\",\n  \"INVOICE_NUMBER\": \"{{ $json.Rechnungsnummer }}\",\n  \"DOCUMENT_DATE\": \"{{ $now.toISO() }}\"\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {
          "stripBinary": false
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Indexfelder setzen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "document",
        "operation": "upload",
        "fileCabinetId": "",
        "storeDialogId": "",
        "binaryPropertyName": "Beleg",
        "fieldsMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "DocuWare Upload",
      "type": "@benheidenreich/n8n-nodes-docuware.docuWare",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [440, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "docuWareApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "DocuWare API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "fileCabinet",
        "operation": "getFields",
        "fileCabinetId": "",
        "fieldsOutput": "template"
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Get Fields (Vorlage holen)",
      "type": "@benheidenreich/n8n-nodes-docuware.docuWare",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 240],
      "credentials": {
        "docuWareApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
